ak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH1VMTBXB0TQZNVSQ0ATCS2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで見てくださってありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高本彩花"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"208"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-20105":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばんは(｡･ω･｡)\n \n \n 初めての握手会、来てくださった方本当にありがとうございました！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYTGM6F9GZYAZ1SRBP8Y200","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n パフォーマンスはとても緊張しましたが、\n 練習してきた成果は出しきれたと思います。\n でも、反省点はたくさんあってまだまだな部分もあったので次の握手会では、そこを改善してより良いパフォーマンスができるように頑張ります！\n \n 振り付けに合わせてサイリウムを振ってくださっている姿や、声援を送ってくださっている姿を見て、うるうるきちゃいました( ´•̥ω•̥` )\n \n \n - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\n \n \n 私はきょんこと同じレーンで、\n きょんこファンの方が優しくて本当に感動しました。\n 終わったあと、ファンの方々の言葉を思い出して二人で泣いちゃいました…\n こんな私にも応援してくださる方がいて、私に勇気づけられたと言ってくださる方もいて本当に本当に嬉しかったです！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYTGNJA3HVGA6W2ST7JXH17","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n （左から、まな、きょんこ）\n きょんまなペア♡\n \n \n 明日も、きょんことペアなので\n 2人で一緒に待ってまーす！\n \n \n \n \n \n 最後まで読んでくださってありがとうございました(｡>ㅅ<｡)*｡\n \n 高瀬愛奈"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-s46-68012":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは🍊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます⊹ ࣪ ˖"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮城県出身20歳\n四期生の山川宇衣（やまかわうい）です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新幹線の窓から\n外の景色を眺めていると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の目線よりも低いところに\n電車が走っていたり\n街並みやそこを歩く人の姿があったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな街の様子を見ながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこか遠い世界を眺めているような気持ちになるのはわたしだけでしょうか\n💭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんそれは\nそこが自分の知らない街だから、\nということとは関係なく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目に見えるその景色ごと\nどこか違う世界のもののように思えるというか…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんというかそんな\n感覚の話になってしまうのだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなく、そんな風に感じます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれは多分いつもより\n目線が高いからとか、速度が速いからとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとそれだけのことなのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元から東京へ向かう新幹線に乗って\n窓の外を見ていると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見慣れた景色も\n自分が身を置く世界とはどこか違うところにあるようで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝手にすこし切ない気分になります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただでさえ新幹線に乗るときは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとどころじゃないくらい、\n寂しい気持ちでいることが多かったので🥲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいまは、新幹線が終点に着いたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと一緒に居られる場所が待っているので もう寂しくないです🍊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんがそこに居てくれるだけで\nとっても心強いです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、いつもそこに居てくれて\n見守っていてくれてありがとうと伝えたくなりました( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう💌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことを\nひとり頭の中で考えていたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミーグリの第3次応募締切が\n今日の14時までだそうで🍊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのことに背中を押してもらって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか伝えたいと思った気持ちを\n今日伝えてみました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたいと思っているのが\nわたしだけじゃなかったらうれしいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます🍊🍊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202602/mobuJnaCO.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネが似合いたい最近のわたし\nです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも似合わないって言ったら\n似合うよってたくさん言ってくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしくなって\nちゃっかりまた自撮りをしてみる\nとっても単純な人間です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202602/mobHpZAi6.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自覚あり\n🤧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202602/mobvk61ar.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーー୨୧ーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"📷今日の一枚"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202602/mobgWtrD8.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜか毎年、\n猫の日をすごく意識している自分がいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"犬派か猫派かと聞かれたら\n悩んだ末に犬派って答えてしまうわたしなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫からしたら、その日だけなんなのって\n調子のいいやつって思われてしまいそうなのだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき通りかかったお店に\n「2月22日は猫の日」って書いてあるのを見つけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日何日だ、！！ってひとりで大焦りしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかった、まだ間に合った…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"😮‍💨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「猫の日」ってあまりにもかわいい言葉ですよね\nたぶん一年で一番かわいい日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫の日当日は\nぜひ一緒にお祝いしましょう🐾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね🐾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うい　#24通目"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-52513":{"blocks":[{"typ